{%- comment -%}
  The landing page (ADR-013 D8 item 3): what METAIS is, who it is for, the
  install command, and "Who makes METAIS" (D2 item 1), in the words Ed
  approved on 2026-10-24 (direction C, "Data in, documents out"). It is a
  page of its own, not the shared layout: its stylesheet is /landing.css,
  and it ends, like every page, with the footer saying METAIS is made by
  Kottera. Its demos are the invoice example's real output; the site's tests
  hold them to what metais prints.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign release = inputs.release -%}
